SEARCH {"collection":"pages_c3f46556ef6b7d3b6d5a2eab","retrievalMs":120.9572090000147,"operation":"seekdb Collection.hybridSearch / DBMS_HYBRID_SEARCH + RRF","results":[{"id":"db-plan","text":"EXPLAIN shows whether a database query scans a whole table or uses an index. Slow queries often improve after an appropriate index, fewer scanned rows, and up-to-date statistics. Measure latency before and after each change.","metadata":{"part":1,"title":"Read a query plan before guessing","source":"本队原创示例摘录"},"distance":0.0325},{"id":"hybrid","text":"Hybrid search combines keyword full-text search and semantic vector search. Reciprocal rank fusion combines ranked candidates inside the database. Exact product names and broader conceptual queries can both benefit.","metadata":{"part":1,"title":"Combine meaning with exact words","source":"本队原创示例摘录"},"distance":0.0323},{"id":"db-index","text":"A database index is like a book index. It lets a query locate matching rows without scanning every record. Index columns used in WHERE filters and JOIN conditions, then use EXPLAIN to inspect the query plan.","metadata":{"part":1,"title":"A shortcut through the database","source":"本队原创示例摘录"},"distance":0.0308},{"id":"transactions","text":"A database transaction groups related changes into an atomic unit. Commit when all steps succeed and roll back on failure. Short transactions reduce the time that locks block other work.","metadata":{"part":1,"title":"Finish a transaction as one unit","source":"本队原创示例摘录"},"distance":0.0308},{"id":"vectors","text":"Embedding models represent text as numerical vectors. Nearby vectors often describe related meanings even when exact words differ. A vector database stores embeddings and retrieves nearby documents.","metadata":{"part":1,"title":"Search by meaning with vectors","source":"本队原创示例摘录"},"distance":0.0303}],"metrics":{"stage":"search","collection":"pages_c3f46556ef6b7d3b6d5a2eab","query":"How can I make database queries faster?","queryEmbeddingMs":14.7